  "body": "The creation/build docs an AI coding agent reads to grok and build the framework were still **v2.3-era** \u2014 they described the pre-Gen-4 system (wrong `examples/vcw/` file layout, the old `<band:entry:M>` reference grammar, 32 invariants, none of the new tissue). An agent following them would build the wrong picture.\n\nThis brings them all into line with the live `mantle/` package (ground truth), the runnable `FIELD_GUIDE.md`, and each other:\n\n- **PRIMER** \u2014 a Gen-4 section, the real `mantle/` document set, new ontology terms (egg, graft, anchoring, symbiosis, self/other, nociception, graded memory, MEM VCW, ganglion, seed vault), and the egg/anchor/graft build paths.\n- **Part 1 (Body + Audit)** \u2014 the genesis key (SELF/OTHER), nociception distress, graded memory, the current `<TARGET.SELECTOR.ADDRESS>` grammar, the 66-invariant executable gate, and a Gen-4 Body invariant table (SELF/NOC/MEMW).\n- **Part 2 (Mind + Audit)** \u2014 event-gated cognition tied to nociception, the metered symbiosis economy, the Compiler-class self-redesign + memory bridge, the MEM VCW, and a Gen-4 Phase-2 invariant table.\n- **Assimilator** \u2014 the automated realization (`assimilate`/`anchor`/`graft`), the `.mantle/` nest.\n- **README** \u2014 Gen-4 framing, the full module layout, extended principles.\n- **examples/README.md** (new) \u2014 separates the current gate-aligned examples from the legacy v2-era HTML/YAML artifacts (flagged not-yet-regenerated).\n\n**Docs only \u2014 ground truth unchanged.** 66/66 invariants still green; the `doctor` docs-vs-code coherence gate passes (README count = live gate).\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
